# No `print` / `debugPrint` around HTTP requests

Follow `ai_toolkit/rules/flutter/remote-data-sources.md` (logging) and `PrettyDioLogger` on `DioHelper`. Never `print`/`debugPrint` URLs, bodies, headers, or responses.
